<https://example.org/wspend/obl> <https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace> <https://example.org/wspend/ws> .
<https://example.org/wspend/obl> <https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#agreement> <https://example.org/wspend/agr> .
<https://example.org/wspend/ev1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Evidence> .
<https://example.org/wspend/ev1> <https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#name> "Manual label approval record" .
