<https://example.org/wspend/prod> <https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#name> "Example Console" .
<https://example.org/wspend/prod> <https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace> <https://example.org/wspend/ws> .
